        "tag": "title",
        "text": "21"
      },
      {
        "y": 24.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 248.5,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "The visual arts"
      },
      {
        "y": 70.7,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 187.8,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Changing tastes"
      },
      {
        "y": 108.9,
        "x0": 307.6,
        "x1": 317.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "T"
      },
      {
        "y": 115.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 492.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Throughout the centuries, people have tended to be"
      },
      {
        "y": 126.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 494.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "suspicious of the new art movements of their period."
      },
      {
        "y": 137.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 506.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "At the end of the 19th century, for example, people were"
      },
      {
        "y": 147.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 504.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "shocked by Impressionism1, criticising its practitioners"
      },
      {
        "y": 158.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 493.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "as careless daubers2. Later, when faced with Cubist3"
      },
      {
        "y": 170.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 491.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "paintings, the public were puzzled by those too. The"
      },
      {
        "y": 180.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 501.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Surrealists4 were initially deemed5 crazy. Op-art6 was"
      },
      {
        "y": 191.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 510.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "criticised because its subject matter7 was said to consist"
      },
      {
        "y": 203.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 495.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "of nothing of significance. However, nowadays, liking"
      },
      {
        "y": 213.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 511.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Surrealism8 or Op-art is considered perfectly acceptable,"
      },
      {
        "y": 224.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 470,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and images from these schools of art9 appear"
      },
      {
        "y": 236.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 491.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "everywhere, from posters to advertising campaigns."
      },
      {
        "y": 247.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 501.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Perhaps because of the ubiquity of advertising, people"
      },
      {
        "y": 257.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 507.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "tend to be more visually literate10 than they used to be,"
      },
      {
        "y": 268.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 501.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and so are perhaps inured to11 surprises. Perhaps new"
      },
      {
        "y": 280.3,
        "x0": 299,
        "x1": 502.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "movements in art will meet with less hostility in future."
      },
      {
        "y": 315.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 511,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1, 3, 4, 6, 8 types of artist and schools of art of the last 150 years 2 someone who paints quickly and carelessly"
      },
      {
        "y": 327.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 487.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(disapproving) 5 considered; formal 7 content 9 art movement 10 educated with regard to art"
      },
      {
        "y": 339.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 164.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "11 not affected by"
      },
      {
        "y": 360.5,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 261.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Words for commenting on art"
      },
      {
        "y": 378.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 376.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "original: new in a special and interesting way (opp. = predictable)"
      },
      {
        "y": 392.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 479.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "highbrow: intended for educated, intelligent people (often disapproving) (opp. = lowbrow)"
      },
      {
        "y": 406.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 389.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "impenetrable: extremely difficult to understand (opp. = transparent)"
      },
      {
        "y": 420.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 423.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "sophisticated: showing advanced skills and understanding (opp. = primitive)"
      },
      {
        "y": 434.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 456.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "challenging: demanding considerable effort to be understood (opp. = undemanding)"
      },
      {
        "y": 448.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 477.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "dazzling: inspiring great admiration because it is brilliant in some way (opp. = pedestrian)"
      },
      {
        "y": 463,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 368.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "evocative: calling up images and memories (opp. = uninspiring)"
      },
      {
        "y": 477.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 372.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "thought-provoking: making people think (opp. = unstimulating)"
      },
      {
        "y": 491.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 337.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "exquisite: having rare beauty or delicacy (opp. = clumsy)"
      },
      {
        "y": 505.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 405,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "intriguing: interesting because it is strange or mysterious (opp. = dreary)"
      },
      {
        "y": 519.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 332.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "peerless: better than any other (opp. = run-of-the-mill)"
      },
      {
        "y": 533.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 501.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "tongue-in-cheek: not intended to be taken seriously, despite appearing serious (opp. = earnest)"
      },
      {
        "y": 547.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 301.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "priceless: extremely valuable (opp. = worthless)"
      },
      {
        "y": 561.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 331.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "skilful: clever, masterly, done well (opp. = poorly done)"
      },
      {
        "y": 583,
        "x0": 75,
        "x1": 197.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "C Art and metaphor"
      },
      {
        "y": 605.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 434.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Notice how words connected with art can be used when talking about literature."
      },
      {
        "y": 630.3,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 506.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The writer paints his hero in a fascinating light. Minor characters are more shadowy or sketchy"
      },
      {
        "y": 642.3,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 489.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "but they are also depicted quite powerfully, even though the focus is, inevitably, on the two"
      },
      {
        "y": 654.3,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 476.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "central characters. These are portrayed with great sensitivity. The heroine is particularly"
      },
      {
        "y": 666.3,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 509.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "colourful and we see how her character is shaped and moulded by events. Some say the author"
      },
      {
        "y": 678.3,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 501,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "illustrates his motifs in a black-and-white fashion, but the image he creates to illuminate the"
      },
      {
        "y": 690.5,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 290.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "evils of slavery will remain with me for ever."
      }
    ],
